msgstr "Single Sign-On med Microsoft Entra ID"

#: view/settings.php:4
msgid ""
"Settings for configuring single sign-on with Microsoft Entra ID can be "
"configured here."
msgstr ""
"Inställningar för att konfigurera Single Sign-On med Microsoft Entra ID kan "
"konfigureras här."

#: view/settings.php:14
msgid "Reset Plugin"
msgstr "Återställ plugin"

#: view/settings.php:15
msgid "Resetting the plugin will completely remove all settings."
msgstr "Återställning av pluginet tar bort alla inställningar."

#: view/settings.php:25
msgid "Reset Settings"
msgstr "Återställ inställningar"

#: view/settings.php:26
msgid ""
"Reset the plugin to default settings. Careful, there is no undo for this."
msgstr ""
"Återställ pluginet till standardinställningar. Var försiktig, detta kan inte "
"ångras."

#: view/settings.php:31
msgid "Migrate Legacy Settings"
msgstr "Migrera äldre inställningar"

#: view/settings.php:33
#, php-format
msgid "Old configuration data was found at %s."
msgstr "Gammal konfigurationsdata hittades vid %s."

#: view/settings.php:36
msgid "This configuration data can be migrated automatically."
msgstr "Denna konfigurationsdata kan migreras automatiskt."

#: view/settings.php:38
#, php-format
msgid "Delete the file at %s to hide this migration utility."
msgstr "Radera filen vid %s för att dölja detta migreringsverktyg."

#: view/settings.php:45
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If migration is successful, migration will delete this configuration file, "
"%s."
msgstr "Om migreringen lyckas, kommer konfigurationsfilen %s att raderas."

#: view/settings.php:50
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If migration is successful, migration will be unable to delete the "
"configuration file at %s.  It is recommended to delete the file after "
"migration."
msgstr ""
"Om migreringen lyckas, kommer konfigurationsfilen %s inte att kunna raderas. "
"Det rekommenderas att radera filen efter migreringen."

#: view/settings.php:63
msgid "Migrate Settings"
msgstr "Migrera inställningar"

#: view/settings.php:64
msgid ""
"Migrate settings from old plugin versions to new configuration. This will "
"overwrite existing settings! Careful, there is no undo for this."
msgstr ""
"Migrera inställningar från gamla plugin-versioner till ny konfiguration. "
"Detta kommer att skriva över befintliga inställningar! Var försiktig, detta "
"kan inte ångras."

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "http://github.com/psignoret/aad-sso-wordpress"
msgstr "http://github.com/psignoret/aad-sso-wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Allows you to use your organization's Microsoft Entra ID (formerly known as "
"Azure Active Directory) user accounts to log in to WordPress. If your "
"organization is using Office 365, your user accounts are already in "
"Microsoft Entra ID. This plugin uses OAuth 2.0 to authenticate users, and "
"the Microsoft Graph API to get group membership and other details."
msgstr ""
"Tillåter dig att använda din organisations Microsoft Entra ID (tidigare känt "
"som Azure Active Directory) användarkonton för att logga in på WordPress. Om "
"din organisation använder Office 365, finns dina användarkonton redan i "
"Microsoft Entra ID. Detta plugin använder OAuth 2.0 för att autentisera "
"användare och Microsoft Graph API för att hämta gruppmedlemskap och andra "
"detaljer."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Philippe Signoret"
msgstr "Philippe Signoret"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://www.psignoret.com/"
msgstr "https://www.psignoret.com/"
